40. FINANCIAL SAFE STATES

NORMAL
DEGRADED
RESTRICTED
PAPER_ONLY
HALTED
RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED
EMERGENCY_STOP

A failure in one component should not unnecessarily destroy the whole CNS, but financial safety can force restricted operation.

Safe-state transitions must lead to the configured safe/restricted financial state appropriate to the detected failure and policy.


