54. FINAL CHECKER ATTACK

I attacked V1.1 specifically for the dangerous failure modes.

Can a bot bypass risk?

No.

Can two bots overspend available capital?

Atomic reservation prevents it.

Can broker state silently diverge from CNS?

Reconciliation is mandatory.

Can duplicate orders happen after retry?

Idempotency + reconciliation.

Can stale data trigger live execution?

Freshness gate.

Can corporate actions corrupt historical research?

Instrument/corporate-action authority plus effective dating.

Can paper state leak into live?

Account/environment isolation.

Can partial fills create incorrect portfolio state?

Explicit partial-fill state + reconciliation.

Can 3G become another research system?

No. 3F owns evaluation.

Can 3G become another resource manager?

No. 3D owns resources.

Can 3G become another brain?

No. 3B owns cognition.

Can an LLM become a single point of financial failure?

No.

Did we create another unnecessary log?

No.

Did we leave obvious financial-operating machinery outside 3G?

No material gap found.


---

🟢 FINAL MANAGER DECISION

3G V1.1 — FINAL / CHECKED / FROZEN

This is the corrected master version to save.

The corrections were genuinely necessary, especially:

Financial Ledger

Instrument / Corporate Actions

Account Isolation

Atomic Capital Reservation

Stale-Data Protection

Partial-Fill Mechanics

Post-Trade / Continuous Risk

Liquidity / Capacity

Effective-dated corporate actions

Financial-state reconstruction/reconciliation

Crash-recovery safety gate


And I deliberately did not add new logs for these. They belong inside 3G.

So our frozen construction line is now:

1    Constitution                         ✅
2    Capability Intelligence              ✅
3A   Foundation / Runtime                 ✅
3B   Brain / Cognition                    ✅
3C   Work / Orchestration                 ✅
3D   Resource Fabric                      ✅
3E   Memory / Experience                  ✅
3F   Verification / Research / Decision   ✅
